  "body": "### What is the issue with the URL Pattern Standard?\r\n\r\nAs per https://whatwg.org/working-mode#anchors could we please make the following anchors permanent?\r\n\r\n* https://urlpattern.spec.whatwg.org/#url-pattern-create\r\n* https://urlpattern.spec.whatwg.org/#url-pattern-match\r\n* https://urlpattern.spec.whatwg.org/#url-pattern-has-regexp-groups\r\n\r\nThese are used by the [compression dictionary](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-httpbis-compression-dictionary/) spec.",
